// @ts-nocheck — 고객 화면 4: 개선 방향 (Phase 6 — LLM 추천 + 액션 전환 + 적중률).
import { useMemo, useState } from "react";
import { useParams } from "react-router-dom";
import { useMutation, useQuery, useQueryClient } from "@tanstack/react-query";
import {
  Sparkles, TrendingUp, Zap, Clock, Bell, X, ArrowRight, RefreshCw,
  CheckCircle2, AlertTriangle, Loader2, Target,
  FileCode, Copy, Globe, Link as LinkIcon,
} from "lucide-react";
import { v3RecommendationsApi } from "./dataHub";
import type { V3Recommendation, V3RecCategory, V3RecPriority } from "./dataHub/types";
import { HeaderDiagnosticButton } from "./V3DiagnosticPanel";
import { runImprovementPlanDiagnostics } from "./diagnostics/improvementPlanDiagnostics";

const CATEGORY_LABEL: Record<V3RecCategory, string> = {
  technical: "기술", content: "콘텐츠", common: "공통", marketing: "마케팅", other: "기타",
};
const CATEGORY_TONE: Record<V3RecCategory, string> = {
  technical: "bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-300 border-blue-500/30",
  content: "bg-purple-500/15 text-purple-300 border-purple-500/30",
  common: "bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300 border-emerald-500/30",
  marketing: "bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-300 border-amber-500/30",
  other: "bg-neutral-500/15 text-neutral-300 border-neutral-500/30",
};
const PRIORITY_TONE: Record<V3RecPriority, string> = {
  P1: "bg-red-500/20 text-red-300 border-red-500/40",
  P2: "bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border-amber-500/40",
  P3: "bg-neutral-500/20 text-neutral-300 border-neutral-500/40",
};

export function PortalV3ImprovementPlan() {
  const { id } = useParams<{ id: string }>();
  const qc = useQueryClient();
  const [converting, setConverting] = useState<V3Recommendation | null>(null);

  const listQ = useQuery({
    queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs", id],
    queryFn: () => v3RecommendationsApi.list(id!),
    enabled: !!id,
  });
  const hitRateQ = useQuery({
    queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs-hit", id],
    queryFn: () => v3RecommendationsApi.getHitRate(id!),
    enabled: !!id,
  });
  const hitRateTrendQ = useQuery({
    queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs-hit-trend", id],
    queryFn: () => v3RecommendationsApi.getHitRateTrend(id!, 6),
    enabled: !!id,
  });

  const generateM = useMutation({
    mutationFn: () => v3RecommendationsApi.generate(id!),
    onSuccess: () => qc.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs", id] }),
  });
  const dismissM = useMutation({
    mutationFn: (recId: string) => v3RecommendationsApi.dismiss(id!, recId),
    onSuccess: () => qc.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs", id] }),
  });
  const snoozeM = useMutation({
    mutationFn: (recId: string) => v3RecommendationsApi.snooze(id!, recId, 7),
    onSuccess: () => qc.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs", id] }),
  });

  const data = listQ.data;
  const pending = data?.groups.pending || [];
  const converted = data?.groups.converted || [];

  // 7일+ 방치된 pending (snoozedUntil 안 걸린 것)
  const staleAlerts = useMemo(() => {
    const now = Date.now();
    const week = 7 * 86400000;
    return pending.filter((r) => {
      if (r.snoozedUntil && new Date(r.snoozedUntil).getTime() > now) return false;
      return new Date(r.generatedAt).getTime() < now - week;
    });
  }, [pending]);

  return (
    <>
      {id && <HeaderDiagnosticButton boardId={id} title="Improvement Plan Diagnostics" runner={runImprovementPlanDiagnostics} />}
      <div className="mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-5 px-4 py-6">
        <header className="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div className="flex-1">
            <div className="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">Client / 개선 방향</div>
            <h1 className="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--shell-text)]">AI 검색결과 개선 방향</h1>
            <p className="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
              측정 결과 + 브랜드 컨텍스트 기반으로 Claude 가 자동 생성하는 GEO 개선안.
              Impact × Effort 매트릭스와 예상 효과 (±%p) 를 함께 제공합니다.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button
            type="button"
            onClick={() => {
              if (confirm("기존 pending 추천을 모두 dismissed 로 정리한 뒤 새로 생성합니다. 진행할까요?")) {
                generateM.mutate();
              }
            }}
            disabled={generateM.isPending}
            className="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-[var(--shell-accent)] bg-[var(--shell-accent)]/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--shell-accent)] hover:bg-[var(--shell-accent)]/20 disabled:opacity-50"
          >
            {generateM.isPending ? <Loader2 className="h-4 w-4 animate-spin" /> : <RefreshCw className="h-4 w-4" />}
            추천 다시 생성
          </button>
        </header>

        {/* 적중률 + 시계열 */}
        {hitRateQ.data && (
          <section className="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel)] p-4">
            <div className="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
              <div className="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--shell-text)]">
                  <Target className="h-4 w-4" /> 추천 적중률
                </div>
                <div className="mt-1 text-[11px] text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
                  액션 전환 후 7일 효과 윈도우에서 자사 언급률 +1%p 이상 증가한 비율
                </div>
              </div>
              <div className="text-right shrink-0">
                <div className={`text-3xl font-semibold ${
                  hitRateQ.data.hitRate >= 60 ? "text-emerald-300" :
                  hitRateQ.data.hitRate >= 30 ? "text-amber-300" :
                  "text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]"
                }`}>
                  {hitRateQ.data.totalConverted === 0 ? "—" : `${hitRateQ.data.hitRate.toFixed(0)}%`}
                </div>
                <div className="text-[10px] text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">
                  {hitRateQ.data.effective} / {hitRateQ.data.totalConverted} 액션 (전체)
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* 시계열 그래프 (지난 6개월) */}
            {hitRateTrendQ.data && hitRateTrendQ.data.trend.length > 0 && (
              <div className="mt-4 border-t border-[var(--shell-border)] pt-3">
                <div className="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">
                  <span>최근 6개월 시계열 (액션 전환 + 효과 검증)</span>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span className="flex items-center gap-1"><span className="h-1.5 w-3 rounded bg-blue-400" /> 전환 액션</span>
                    <span className="flex items-center gap-1"><span className="h-1.5 w-3 rounded bg-emerald-400" /> 적중률 %</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <HitRateTrendChart trend={hitRateTrendQ.data.trend} />
              </div>
            )}
          </section>
        )}

        {/* Stale alerts */}
        {staleAlerts.length > 0 && (
          <div className="rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/5 p-3">
            <div className="flex items-start gap-2">
              <AlertTriangle className="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-amber-400" />
              <div className="flex-1 text-xs text-amber-200">
                <strong>{staleAlerts.length}건의 추천이 7일+ 방치 중</strong> — 액션 전환 또는 스누즈하세요.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        )}

        {/* Generate 진행 / 실패 */}
        {generateM.isError && (
          <div className="rounded-xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/5 p-3 text-xs text-red-300">
            추천 생성 실패: {String((generateM.error as any)?.message || generateM.error)}
          </div>
        )}
        {generateM.isSuccess && (
          <div className="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-3 text-xs text-emerald-300">
            ✓ {generateM.data?.generated}건의 추천이 새로 생성되었습니다.
          </div>
        )}

        {listQ.isLoading && (
          <div className="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel)] py-12 text-center text-sm text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
            <Loader2 className="mx-auto h-5 w-5 animate-spin" />
            <div className="mt-2">불러오는 중...</div>
          </div>
        )}

        {!listQ.isLoading && pending.length === 0 && converted.length === 0 && (
          <div className="rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel)] p-8 text-center">
            <Sparkles className="mx-auto h-6 w-6 text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]" />
            <div className="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--shell-text)]">아직 추천이 없습니다</div>
            <div className="mt-1 text-[11px] text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
              측정을 먼저 실행하면 분석 완료 후 자동으로 추천이 생성됩니다.
              또는 위의 "추천 다시 생성" 을 누르세요.
            </div>
          </div>
        )}

        {/* Impact × Effort 매트릭스 */}
        {pending.length > 0 && (
          <section className="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel)] p-5">
            <div className="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--shell-text)]">Impact × Effort 매트릭스 (Pending {pending.length})</div>
            <div className="mt-1 text-[11px] text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
              우측 상단 = 효과 크고 쉬움 (즉시 실행 추천)
            </div>
            <ImpactEffortMatrix recs={pending} />
          </section>
        )}

        {/* ★ 추천 카드 리스트 — 엔진별 분리 (격차 클 때만 perEngine 섹션 생김) */}
        {pending.length > 0 && (() => {
          const general = pending.filter((r) => !r.targetEngine);
          const gptOnly = pending.filter((r) => r.targetEngine === "gpt");
          const geminiOnly = pending.filter((r) => r.targetEngine === "gemini");
          return (
            <>
              {general.length > 0 && (
                <section>
                  <h2 className="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--shell-text)]">
                    📌 검토할 추천 <span className="text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">({general.length})</span>
                    <span className="ml-2 text-[10px] font-normal text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">두 엔진 모두에 효과</span>
                  </h2>
                  <ul className="space-y-2">
                    {general.map((r) => (
                      <RecommendationCard key={r.id} rec={r}
                        onConvert={() => setConverting(r)}
                        onDismiss={() => { if (confirm("이 추천을 기각하시겠습니까?")) dismissM.mutate(r.id); }}
                        onSnooze={() => snoozeM.mutate(r.id)} />
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                </section>
              )}
              {gptOnly.length > 0 && (
                <section className="rounded-2xl border-2 border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-500/5 p-4">
                  <h2 className="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-300">
                    <span className="rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px]">GPT 전용</span>
                    GPT 결과 개선 추천 <span className="text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">({gptOnly.length})</span>
                  </h2>
                  <div className="mb-3 text-[11px] text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
                    엔진 격차 분석에서 자동 생성. GPT 의 web_search 가 인용하는 출처 / 학습 데이터 / 인덱싱 패턴 보강 액션.
                  </div>
                  <ul className="space-y-2">
                    {gptOnly.map((r) => (
                      <RecommendationCard key={r.id} rec={r}
                        onConvert={() => setConverting(r)}
                        onDismiss={() => { if (confirm("이 추천을 기각하시겠습니까?")) dismissM.mutate(r.id); }}
                        onSnooze={() => snoozeM.mutate(r.id)} />
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                </section>
              )}
              {geminiOnly.length > 0 && (
                <section className="rounded-2xl border-2 border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4">
                  <h2 className="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300">
                    <span className="rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px]">Gemini 전용</span>
                    Gemini 결과 개선 추천 <span className="text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">({geminiOnly.length})</span>
                  </h2>
                  <div className="mb-3 text-[11px] text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">
                    엔진 격차 분석에서 자동 생성. Gemini grounding (Google Search 기반) 친화 액션 — Google Business Profile / Naver SEO / 한국어 백링크.
                  </div>
                  <ul className="space-y-2">
                    {geminiOnly.map((r) => (
                      <RecommendationCard key={r.id} rec={r}
                        onConvert={() => setConverting(r)}
                        onDismiss={() => { if (confirm("이 추천을 기각하시겠습니까?")) dismissM.mutate(r.id); }}
                        onSnooze={() => snoozeM.mutate(r.id)} />
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                </section>
              )}
            </>
          );
        })()}

        {/* 전환 완료된 추천 */}
        {converted.length > 0 && (
          <section>
            <h2 className="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--shell-text)]">
              ✅ 액션으로 전환됨 <span className="text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">({converted.length})</span>
            </h2>
            <ul className="space-y-2">
              {converted.map((r) => (
                <li key={r.id} className="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4">
                  <div className="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-400" />
                    <div className="flex-1">
                      <div className="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--shell-text)]">{r.title}</div>
                      <div className="mt-1 text-[10px] text-emerald-300">
                        액션 전환: {r.convertedAt ? new Date(r.convertedAt).toLocaleString() : "-"}
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </section>
        )}

        {/* ★ Step E - llms.txt + schema 추천 답안 카드 */}
        <V4LlmsTxtSuggestionCard onboardingId={id!} />
      </div>

      {converting && (
        <ConvertModal
          boardId={id!}
          rec={converting}
          onClose={() => setConverting(null)}
          onConverted={() => {
            setConverting(null);
            qc.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-recs", id] });
            qc.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ["portalV3", "v3-actions", id] });
          }}
        />
      )}
    </>
  );
}

// ─── Recommendation Card ─────────────────────────────────────

function RecommendationCard({
  rec, onConvert, onDismiss, onSnooze,
}: {
  rec: V3Recommendation;
  onConvert: () => void;
  onDismiss: () => void;
  onSnooze: () => void;
}) {
  const delta = rec.expectedDelta ? parseFloat(rec.expectedDelta) : 0;

  return (
    <li className="rounded-xl border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel)] p-4">
      <div className="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-2">
        <span className={`shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold ${PRIORITY_TONE[rec.priority]}`}>
          {rec.priority}
        </span>
        <span className={`shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] ${CATEGORY_TONE[rec.category]}`}>
          {CATEGORY_LABEL[rec.category]}
        </span>
        {rec.targetEngine === "gpt" && (
          <span className="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-blue-500/40 bg-blue-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-blue-300">GPT 전용</span>
        )}
        {rec.targetEngine === "gemini" && (
          <span className="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-emerald-300">Gemini 전용</span>
        )}
        <h3 className="flex-1 min-w-0 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--shell-text)]">{rec.title}</h3>
      </div>

      <p className="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]">{rec.description}</p>

      {rec.rationale && (
        <div className="mt-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-500/20 bg-blue-500/5 px-3 py-2 text-[10px] text-blue-200">
          💡 <strong>근거:</strong> {rec.rationale}
        </div>
      )}

      {/* Metrics */}
      <div className="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[10px]">
        <span className="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel-soft)] px-2 py-0.5">
          <TrendingUp className="h-3 w-3 text-emerald-300" /> Impact: {rec.impactScore}/5
        </span>
        <span className="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel-soft)] px-2 py-0.5">
          <Zap className="h-3 w-3 text-amber-300" /> Effort: {rec.effortScore}/5
        </span>
        {delta !== 0 && (
          <span className={`flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-2 py-0.5 ${
            delta > 0 ? "border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300" : "border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 text-red-300"
          }`}>
            예상 {delta > 0 ? "+" : ""}{delta.toFixed(1)}%p
          </span>
        )}
      </div>

      {/* Related queries */}
      {rec.relatedQueries && rec.relatedQueries.length > 0 && (
        <div className="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1">
          {rec.relatedQueries.slice(0, 5).map((q, i) => (
            <span key={i} className="rounded-full border border-[var(--shell-border)] bg-[var(--shell-panel-soft)] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-[var(--shell-text-muted)]" title={q}>
              Q: {q.length > 24 ? q.slice(0, 24) + "…" : q}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      )}

      {/* Actions */}
      <div className="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-[var(--shell-border)] pt-3">
        <button
          onClick={onConvert}
          className="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[var(--shell-accent)] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white hover:opacity-90"
        >
          <ArrowRight className="h-3 w-3" /> 액션으로 전환
        </button>
        <button
          onClick={onSnooze}
          className="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--shell-border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--shell-text-muted)] hover:bg-[var(--shell-panel-soft)]"
        >
          <Bell className="h-3 w-3" /> 7일 미루기
        </button>
        <button
          onClick={onDismiss}
          className="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--shell-border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--shell-text-soft)] hover:bg-red-500/10 hover:text-red-300 ml-auto"
        >
          <X className="h-3 w-3" /> 기각
        </button>
      </div>

      <div className="mt-2 text-[9px] text-[var(--shell-text-soft)]">
        생성: {new Date(rec.generatedAt).toLocaleString()} · {rec.generatorModel}
      </div>
    </li>
  );
}

// ─── Impact × Effort Matrix ───────────────────────────

function ImpactEffortMatrix({ recs }: { recs: V3Recommendation[] }) {
  const size = 240;
  const padding = 30;
  const innerSize = size - padding * 2;

  return (
    <div className="mt-3 flex justify-center">
      <div className="relative" style={{ width: size, height: size }}>
        <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${size} ${size}`} className="block">
          {/* Quadrants */}
          <rect x={padding} y={padding} width={innerSize / 2} height={innerSize / 2} fill="rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.06)" />          {/* TL: High impact, Low effort (best) */}
          <rect x={padding + innerSize / 2} y={padding} width={innerSize / 2} height={innerSize / 2} fill="rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.06)" /> {/* TR: High impact, High effort */}
          <rect x={padding} y={padding + innerSize / 2} width={innerSize / 2} height={innerSize / 2} fill="rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.04)" /> {/* BL: Low impact, Low effort */}
          <rect x={padding + innerSize / 2} y={padding + innerSize / 2} width={innerSize / 2} height={innerSize / 2} fill="rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.06)" /> {/* BR: Low impact, High effort */}

          {/* Axes */}
          <line x1={padding} y1={size - padding} x2={size - padding} y2={size - padding} stroke="currentColor" strokeOpacity={0.2} />
          <line x1={padding} y1={padding} x2={padding} y2={size - padding} stroke="currentColor" strokeOpacity={0.2} />
          <line x1={padding + innerSize / 2} y1={padding} x2={padding + innerSize / 2} y2={size - padding} stroke="currentColor" strokeOpacity={0.1} strokeDasharray="2 2" />
          <line x1={padding} y1={padding + innerSize / 2} x2={size - padding} y2={padding + innerSize / 2} stroke="currentColor" strokeOpacity={0.1} strokeDasharray="2 2" />

          {/* Labels */}
          <text x={padding / 2} y={padding + innerSize / 4} textAnchor="middle" className="fill-[var(--shell-text-soft)] text-[9px]" transform={`rotate(-90, ${padding / 2}, ${padding + innerSize / 4})`}>Impact ↑</text>
          <text x={padding + innerSize / 2} y={size - 4} textAnchor="middle" className="fill-[var(--shell-text-soft)] text-[9px]">Effort →</text>

          <text x={padding + innerSize / 4} y={padding - 4} textAnchor="middle" className="fill-emerald-400 text-[9px] font-semibold">즉시 실행</text>
          <text x={padding + (innerSize * 3) / 4} y={padding - 4} textAnchor="middle" className="fill-amber-400 text-[9px] font-semibold">큰 작업</text>
          <text x={padding + innerSize / 4} y={size - padding + 12} textAnchor="middle" className="fill-neutral-500 text-[9px]">부가</text>
          <text x={padding + (innerSize * 3) / 4} y={size - padding + 12} textAnchor="middle" className="fill-red-400 text-[9px]">회피</text>

          {/* Dots */}
          {recs.map((r, i) => {
            // X = effort (1-5) → 0..innerSize
            // Y = impact (1-5) → 0..innerSize (역방향)
            const x = padding + ((r.effortScore - 1) / 4) * innerSize;
            const y = padding + (1 - (r.impactScore - 1) / 4) * innerSize;
            const color = r.priority === "P1" ? "#ef4444" : r.priority === "P2" ? "#f59e0b" : "#9ca3af";
            return (
              <g key={r.id}>
                <circle cx={x} cy={y} r="6" fill={color} fillOpacity={0.8} stroke="white" strokeWidth="1.5" />
                <title>{r.title}</title>
              </g>
            );
          })}
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

